{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":"","Fields":[{"Label":"","Value":"<p>My name is Patty Jordan. Kristen Bullock and I work as a team and we are the BDW Dominican Republic Specialists. We have been to the Dominican Republic several times and have had the opportunity to visit and tour many of the wonderful resort options for the perfect destination wedding. We have always visited the popular off site wedding venue The Jellyfish Restaurant. The Jellyfish is an awesome wedding choice and Mayte is absolutely wonderful. She is so talented and works with each couple individually to plan their special day. Please feel free to contact us with any of your questions at patty@wrighttravelagency.com. Thanks! TA Patty & TA Kristen \u00a0<\/p>\n","Type":"string"}]},{"Title":"Community Stats","Fields":[{"Label":"Group","Value":"Insiders","Type":"string"},{"Label":"Active Posts","Value":90,"Type":"int"},{"Label":"Profile Views","Value":1689,"Type":"int"},{"Label":"Member Title","Value":"Insiders","Type":"string"},{"Label":"Birthday","Value":"January 2","Type":"string"}]},{"Title":"Contact Methods","Fields":[{"Label":"AIM","Value":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","Type":"string"}]}],"Pages":null,"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
