Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":542,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1907950,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285409,"Name":"Adg1121","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1448900182,"LastPoster":{"Id":285516,"Name":"bfvietnam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1907950,"PostDate":1448900182,"PostContent":"Hello everyone, I am recently engaged and already driving myself crazy thinking about planning a...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drecio4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"151.202.50.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448244009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Adg1121","Id":285409,"Name":"Adg1121","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"40.128.66.161","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79769,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f12bdc53ca1ba3f9adfc24c0855aeccb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone, I am recently engaged and already driving myself crazy thinking about planning a destination wedding. I have read a lot of positive review for both resorts but I would like some feedback from past brides. Please let me know what were some of the things that made you choose Now Larimar or Dreams. I am leaning a little more towards Dreams but I keep reading so many great reviews for Now Larimar which adds more to the confusion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907950,"PostDate":1448900182,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone, I am recently engaged and already driving myself crazy thinking about planning a destination wedding. I have read a lot of positive review for both resorts but I would like some feedback from past brides. Please let me know what were some of the things that made you choose Now Larimar or Dreams. I am leaning a little more towards Dreams but I keep reading so many great reviews for Now Larimar which adds more to the confusion.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drecio4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"151.202.50.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448244009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Adg1121","Id":285409,"Name":"Adg1121","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.88.206.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79769,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0202dca5f093262ea80f524bfe4abc6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Good Morning and congratulations on your engagement!! My name is Patty and I am one of the Wright Travel\/BDW TA&#039;s. I have been to Now Larimar, Dreams Palm Beach and Dreams Punta Cana and they are all nice properties. Now Larimar and Dreams Palm Beach are in the Bavaro area and approx 15 - 20 from the airport. Dreams Punta Cana is farther north in the Uvero Alta area, approx 45 - 60 minutes from the airport. They are all AMResort properties so their group amenities and wedding package options will be the same, depending on where you&#039;d like the ceremony, the two Dreams properties have gazebos, they all offer the beach as an option and Now Larimar has a nice fountain area which it a little more private. The rooms at Dreams Palm Punta Cana are a little smaller than the other two and depending on the makeup of your group Dreams Palm Beach is a little more \"low key\" than the other two. I have fact sheets, e-brochures and wedding guides for all three resorts so just let me know if you&#039;d like me to send these to you, my email is patty@wrighttravelagency.com. I hope this helps and please let me know if you have any additional questions. Thanks! TA Patty&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907951,"PostDate":1448903808,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good Morning and congratulations on your engagement!! My name is Patty and I am one of the Wright Travel\/BDW TA's. I have been to Now Larimar, Dreams Palm Beach and Dreams Punta Cana and they are all nice properties. Now Larimar and Dreams Palm Beach are in the Bavaro area and approx 15 - 20 from the airport. Dreams Punta Cana is farther north in the Uvero Alta area, approx 45 - 60 minutes from the airport. They are all AMResort properties so their group amenities and wedding package options will be the same, depending on where you'd like the ceremony, the two Dreams properties have gazebos, they all offer the beach as an option and Now Larimar has a nice fountain area which it a little more private. The rooms at Dreams Palm Punta Cana are a little smaller than the other two and depending on the makeup of your group Dreams Palm Beach is a little more \"low key\" than the other two. I have fact sheets, e-brochures and wedding guides for all three resorts so just let me know if you'd like me to send these to you, my email is patty@wrighttravelagency.com. I hope this helps and please let me know if you have any additional questions. Thanks! TA Patty\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278657480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"112.72.71.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79769,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f35de25b6ee28e32f03a1988e47915e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Please let me know what were some of the things that made you choose Now Larimar or Dreams :lol: :lol:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908107,"PostDate":1449215210,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Please let me know what were some of the things that made you choose Now Larimar or Dreams <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/hatchongam.vn'>h\u1ea1t ch\u1ed1ng \u1ea9m \u1edf h\u00e0 n\u1ed9i<\/a>","Email":"bfvietnam11@gmail.com","IpAddress":"112.72.71.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449214666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bfvietnam","Id":285516,"Name":"bfvietnam","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79769","Title":"Help... Now Larimar Vs Dreams Punta Cana","LastPostDate":1449215210},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
