ld start a 2016 Majestic Elegance bride forum. I&#039;m planning for my wedding to be on March 15th 2016. I&#039;m hoping to have the ceremony on the beach in the gazebo. I would really like to have a private reception but I&#039;m still looking into the costs associated. Does anyone have ideas about photographers? From what I&#039;ve read, the on-site service is not reliable.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sarah&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871441,"PostDate":1410435940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I thought I would start a 2016 Majestic Elegance bride forum. I'm planning for my wedding to be on March 15th 2016. I'm hoping to have the ceremony on the beach in the gazebo. I would really like to have a private reception but I'm still looking into the costs associated. Does anyone have ideas about photographers? From what I've read, the on-site service is not reliable.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sarah<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahsamuelwedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.206.2.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410273450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279746.jpg?_r=1410435597","PhotoWidth":50,"PhotoHeight":50,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sarah835","Id":279746,"Name":"Sarah835","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.161.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"I